 "keys": "The car key the decoder makes (telemetry_formats._codemasters): dirt/<max rpm>-<idle rpm>-<gears>, the rpm rounded to 10. The game sends no car name, so a key lists every car with that engine and gearbox, in dr2_logger's order; two or more are shown as 'A / B' until the learnt drivetrain or gearing tells them apart. class is the section dr2_logger lists the car under.",
